  "description": "A 2050-high cupboard in the corner, 900 along the back wall and 1150 out along the left wall, with a pair of 437 doors on its end, facing the kitchen. Opened to 90°, they reach 1587 from the back wall, past the room door's hinge at 1400: they can't open fully while the room door is open. On its side facing the windows, a fold-down desk 780 wide and 500 deep, hinged along its bottom edge: open, it's level, its oak top 740 high, reaching 1400 from the left wall, on two folding brackets; closed, it stands upright against the side, up to 1240. Beside it, a 400-wide, 330-deep open bookshelf (x 900-1300), 2050 high, from the floor, sharing the cupboard's side, with 5 lit shelves 382 long, their tops at 354, 689, 1025, 1361, 1696. Bench 2538, from x = 1300, 330 deep. Inside, within its 18 boards (rear panels against the walls included): 864 × 1114, 2014 high. Above the bench: a 75\" TV (1680 × 960), centred on the 2538 of clear wall, from 1100 to 2060. A 250-deep shelf right across above it, 2538 long, at 2210. A sofa facing the TV, the Drift Oak Sofa Bed (Futon Company): 1480 wide, 790 deep, 670 high, its seat at 390. Its front is 1900 from the TV wall (x 1829-3309, y 1900-2690).From option 10 (new)",
